2
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:56,749
<i>Shunkin Monogatari / The Story of Shunkin (1954)</i>

3
00:02:14,959 --> 00:02:18,606
The time of the old school era,

4
00:02:19,164 --> 00:02:21,464
around the end of the Tokugawa government

5
00:02:22,730 --> 00:02:24,820
In Osaka,

6
00:02:26,725 --> 00:02:33,350
There is a place called Doshomachi
where only Medicinal Liquor Wholesaler

7
00:02:33,703 --> 00:02:38,903
This is one of Osaka’s oldest and most historic neighborhoods.

8
00:02:40,528 --> 00:02:45,082
At that time, in May of the third year
of Keio, on the day of the Tango Festival,

9
00:02:46,188 --> 00:02:49,132
The Prime Minister of Goshu,

10
00:02:49,285 --> 00:02:59,028
Hinoya Kahei, accompanied by his heir, Sasuke, traveled all the way from Goshu.

11
00:02:59,938 --> 00:03:06,060
This is one of the oldest establishments Medicinal Liquor Wholesaler in Doshomachi

12
00:03:06,808 --> 00:03:13,418
Sasuke was to be sent as an apprentice to the shop of Mozuya Yasudaimon,

13
00:03:13,446 --> 00:03:20,271
a well-known and long-established pharmaceutical wholesaler in Doshomachi, to learn the ropes of the business

14
00:03:30,484 --> 00:03:31,351
Oh Koji-sama

15
00:03:32,035 --> 00:03:35,805
This is the second lady,Okoto from the Ito clan

16
00:03:40,633 --> 00:03:45,145
You go to lessons for shamisen or okoto

17
00:03:48,289 --> 00:03:54,879
The protagonist of this story,
Okoto (later known as Shunkin),

18
00:03:55,808 --> 00:04:00,166
She lost both of her eyes in a
sudden incident several years ago

19
00:04:01,210 --> 00:04:09,742
Since then, She has been living a pitiful life outside the temple grounds, diligently practicing the shamisen

20
00:04:23,711 --> 00:04:25,391
Sasuke?

21
00:04:42,093 --> 00:04:50,503
Thinking back, the story of love and desire permeated by the mysterious beauty of Sasuke and Okoto,

22
00:04:51,320 --> 00:04:55,983
began at this very moment of their first meeting

23
00:05:01,630 --> 00:05:11,028
And so, eight years later, the world changed to the Meiji era of modernization and civilization, and one day...

24
00:05:14,896 --> 00:05:15,616
One day,

25
00:05:16,673 --> 00:05:26,134
Sasuke's father, Kahei, came to visit the mozuya from Hinourazawa in Goshu

26
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:39,993
Sasuke?

27
00:05:41,126 --> 00:05:41,826
Dad.

28
00:05:46,586 --> 00:05:47,962
It seems you look fine.

29
00:05:52,413 --> 00:05:55,518
Are you well-liked by everyone?

30
00:05:56,302 --> 00:05:56,935
Yes.

31
00:05:58,349 --> 00:06:05,231
I haven't even introduced myself to your master yet, so I feel bad speaking to you

32
00:06:06,013 --> 00:06:08,329
I'll take the permission first.

33
00:06:08,903 --> 00:06:12,279
I'll talk to you later.

34
00:06:13,490 --> 00:06:13,896
I get it.

35
00:06:25,617 --> 00:06:26,251
Shinei-san?

36
00:06:27,583 --> 00:06:31,704
It seems like the supply from the Ibuki area is poor this year

37
00:06:31,854 --> 00:06:32,400
Yeah....

38
00:06:33,530 --> 00:06:39,779
All the medicinal herbs will do their worst in this summer's Sidel

39
00:06:40,350 --> 00:06:44,603
It seems our master's plan worked.

40
00:06:46,835 --> 00:06:47,975
They are here.

41
00:06:52,016 --> 00:06:55,961
Oh? Well, well, I appreciate your respect.

42
00:06:55,986 --> 00:06:56,610
Thanks.

43
00:06:56,867 --> 00:06:59,707
Are you and everyone else safe?

44
00:06:59,930 --> 00:07:01,151
I am deeply grateful for that.

45
00:07:02,572 --> 00:07:06,916
I received and for being able to meet Sasuke.

46
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:09,733
I'd appreciate for that.

47
00:07:10,170 --> 00:07:11,923
He's doing well too

48
00:07:14,110 --> 00:07:14,771
Hey, hey,

49
00:07:14,969 --> 00:07:17,893
Tell Sasuke that his dad is here

50
00:07:18,432 --> 00:07:19,019
I get it.

51
00:07:23,351 --> 00:07:24,131
Sasuke.

52
00:07:25,137 --> 00:07:26,030
Is Sasuke here?

53
00:07:26,081 --> 00:07:27,181
What can I do for you?

54
00:07:28,034 --> 00:07:29,736
Koi-san is about to go for practice

55
00:07:29,771 --> 00:07:30,211
Koi

56
00:07:31,638 --> 00:07:34,638
Tell her not to go for practice today.

57
00:07:34,970 --> 00:07:36,793
Today his dad is here, so...

58
00:07:37,693 --> 00:07:38,406
I get it.

59
00:07:41,256 --> 00:07:43,070
what your dad says is absolutely right,

60
00:07:43,466 --> 00:07:46,153
I'll have to ask you to take over

61
00:07:46,743 --> 00:07:51,321
It's been a while, so I'm sure he has a lot to talk with his son

62
00:07:52,851 --> 00:07:53,264
Oh yeah

63
00:07:54,632 --> 00:07:58,356
Okay then, if you know someone like Sasuke who's used to being led around,

64
00:07:58,992 --> 00:08:02,502
If you know anyone who never complains, please bring him here.

65
00:08:05,840 --> 00:08:06,560
Who's there?

66
00:08:07,238 --> 00:08:08,241
Koi-san

67
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:10,714
Who's there? Hurry up!

68
00:08:11,085 --> 00:08:11,538
I get it.

69
00:08:30,878 --> 00:08:31,805
Sasuke?

70
00:08:33,469 --> 00:08:34,422
Sasuke?

71
00:08:38,021 --> 00:08:39,401
Let us get by

72
00:08:40,040 --> 00:08:42,957
Koi-san has arrived.

73
00:08:45,995 --> 00:08:50,586
The master said she should take the day off today.

74
00:08:52,326 --> 00:08:53,359
Would you like me to take her place?

75
00:08:53,511 --> 00:08:54,205
How stupid

76
00:08:54,313 --> 00:08:57,947
I don't know what to say to Koi-san

77
00:08:59,151 --> 00:09:00,024
I'll go

78
00:09:07,419 --> 00:09:08,352
Sorry for making you wait.

79
00:09:14,223 --> 00:09:15,043
Sasuke?

80
00:09:16,358 --> 00:09:16,992
Yes

81
00:09:40,780 --> 00:09:42,992
What a beautiful.

82
00:09:43,017 --> 00:09:45,186
She's really grown up.

83
00:09:51,264 --> 00:09:51,704
Hey

84
00:09:54,277 --> 00:09:56,385
I told you guys that Sasuke should take a break.

85
00:09:57,465 --> 00:09:59,058
But Koi-san....

86
00:10:03,211 --> 00:10:05,669
No one listens to my orders.

87
00:10:05,769 --> 00:10:06,735
Master

88
00:10:07,929 --> 00:10:10,929
Please be kind to her—she can't see.

89
00:10:11,058 --> 00:10:12,385
Hinode-san

90
00:10:13,157 --> 00:10:17,104
He's very picky, and if he likes her, he'll stick with her

91
00:10:17,856 --> 00:10:21,618
I took Sasuke in to help him become a full-fledged merchant.

92
00:10:22,125 --> 00:10:28,475
I don't think it's a good idea for him to have a relationship with her.

93
00:11:19,473 --> 00:11:21,713
Osshuhan  took a break today?

94
00:11:25,599 --> 00:11:27,989
She's sick today

95
00:11:29,522 --> 00:11:31,048
That's right.

96
00:11:31,815 --> 00:11:33,695
It seems she's caught a cold today,

97
00:11:34,185 --> 00:11:37,775
but she'll still come and watch your lesson

98
00:11:40,312 --> 00:11:41,328
She's done

99
00:11:48,656 --> 00:11:49,712
Sorry to keep you waiting

100
00:11:49,853 --> 00:11:51,793
Goodbye,Goodbye,

101
00:11:56,262 --> 00:11:56,715
Koi-san

102
00:11:57,542 --> 00:12:00,912
Osshuhan is sick today, but I'll teach you today

103
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:05,234
Try to play once.

104
00:12:07,292 --> 00:12:07,972
Sasuke?

105
00:12:09,790 --> 00:12:10,403
I'll go

106
00:12:11,087 --> 00:12:11,647
Koi

107
00:12:12,822 --> 00:12:13,622
Wait

108
00:12:14,892 --> 00:12:17,892
Aren't you going to take my lessons?

109
00:12:18,947 --> 00:12:19,614
Koi

110
00:12:20,096 --> 00:12:22,637
I know you're very skilled in our lesson

111
00:12:23,260 --> 00:12:27,583
But Osshuhan asked me to give you some training, so...

112
00:12:30,344 --> 00:12:31,438
Sasuke

113
00:12:40,924 --> 00:12:43,334
Koi-san! Just wait!

114
00:12:44,258 --> 00:12:44,958
Koshi-san!

115
00:12:46,358 --> 00:12:46,998
Teacher

116
00:12:48,032 --> 00:12:49,486
Cut it out.

117
00:12:50,474 --> 00:12:52,471
I know Mozuya is quite something

118
00:12:53,276 --> 00:12:56,890
But, well, I am a woman who used to work at the Imperial Palace

119
00:12:57,570 --> 00:12:59,107
I don't deserve to be made fun of by you.

120
00:13:00,825 --> 00:13:04,334
If you can't accept my training,
then never come here again

121
00:13:07,980 --> 00:13:08,460
Master

122
00:13:08,886 --> 00:13:09,573
This is a battlefield!

123
00:13:10,421 --> 00:13:11,828
What are you talking about?

124
00:13:12,070 --> 00:13:12,916
But Master

125
00:13:13,351 --> 00:13:16,351
I told you I practice Koi.

126
00:13:17,170 --> 00:13:20,679
First of all, with your skills you can no longer teach Koi-san.

127
00:13:21,367 --> 00:13:22,274
So what?

128
00:13:22,915 --> 00:13:25,057
Do you think I'm less skilled than Koi?

129
00:13:25,543 --> 00:13:27,417
Don't say that now!

130
00:13:28,174 --> 00:13:30,170
It's time for you to go for training

131
00:13:30,298 --> 00:13:30,877
Master

132
00:13:30,902 --> 00:13:32,098
Shut up

133
00:13:32,661 --> 00:13:34,168
I told you to go, so you should go!

134
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:47,636
Even at that age, she's still a woman's girl

135
00:13:49,292 --> 00:13:49,812
Koi-san

136
00:13:50,856 --> 00:13:51,949
Let's have our lesson

137
00:13:51,989 --> 00:13:52,502
Yes

138
00:14:37,718 --> 00:14:38,831
Sasuke?

139
00:14:39,639 --> 00:14:40,752
I feel cold

140
00:14:41,933 --> 00:14:43,107
It's cold and snowy

141
00:14:43,548 --> 00:14:45,027
It might start snowing

142
00:14:47,115 --> 00:14:47,841
Sasuke?

143
00:14:49,376 --> 00:14:49,909
Yes

144
00:14:50,534 --> 00:14:51,800
Am I arrogant?

145
00:14:52,227 --> 00:14:52,733
What?

146
00:14:53,962 --> 00:14:55,302
Am I arrogant that much?

147
00:14:56,794 --> 00:14:58,698
I don't think so

148
00:14:59,419 --> 00:15:03,108
You didn't have to care what she said.

149
00:15:03,832 --> 00:15:06,078
Please forget what she said

150
00:15:10,189 --> 00:15:12,180
Master spoils her way too much

151
00:15:12,610 --> 00:15:15,610
Even in Osaka, his training is tough

152
00:15:16,780 --> 00:15:21,230
Among the disciples was Ito Han, who had an experience as a Kengyo (a Buddhist school teacher)

153
00:15:22,165 --> 00:15:27,147
Why does Master pamper her so much?

154
00:15:27,809 --> 00:15:32,682
I've known that girl since she was young

155
00:15:34,043 --> 00:15:36,153
She had a reputation for being good at it.

156
00:15:36,983 --> 00:15:41,350
If she hadn't been blinded,
she would have been great

157
00:15:42,714 --> 00:15:43,988
I feel sorry for her

158
00:15:45,436 --> 00:15:49,168
It's a shame that a girl who was praised for being skillful was born with such talent

159
00:15:49,198 --> 00:15:51,627
No, even now she's neat and tidy,

160
00:15:52,071 --> 00:15:53,405
So, do you treat her differently?

161
00:15:53,635 --> 00:15:54,288
You are stupid.

162
00:15:55,688 --> 00:15:58,498
I am blind.
I don't understand what's so beautiful about her.

163
00:15:59,676 --> 00:16:04,326
What I'm in love with is her skill and natural talent

164
00:16:05,300 --> 00:16:09,158
She is the most talented of my students.

165
00:16:12,437 --> 00:16:13,044
How about me?

166
00:16:15,721 --> 00:16:20,640
I think if I were beautiful, you would treat me differently.

167
00:16:22,645 --> 00:16:23,838
If I were prettier.....

168
00:16:23,910 --> 00:16:24,710
What?

169
00:16:25,814 --> 00:16:28,311
Are you jealous of her?

170
00:16:29,627 --> 00:16:33,421
You can see.
KOI and I can't see.

171
00:16:34,270 --> 00:16:35,920
Don't you think you are happy?

172
00:16:36,616 --> 00:16:39,715
Seriously, all because my eyes are open

173
00:16:39,740 --> 00:16:42,174
I can't help but look at Koi's beautiful face,

174
00:16:43,045 --> 00:16:46,632
I'd rather go blind.

175
00:16:48,618 --> 00:16:49,605
Fine, you idiot

176
00:16:50,551 --> 00:16:52,409
What are you talking about?

177
00:16:53,789 --> 00:16:57,985
KOI is still young.
Try to put yourself in her shoes.

178
00:16:59,271 --> 00:17:01,822
Try being in her position for once

179
00:17:07,729 --> 00:17:10,622
It's tough to be young and blind.

180
00:17:15,381 --> 00:17:17,479
People who can see can't understand how she feels.

181
00:21:53,840 --> 00:21:54,836
Oh! Koi-san !

182
00:22:07,342 --> 00:22:07,915
Did you get hurt?

183
00:22:09,659 --> 00:22:10,113
Koi-san

184
00:22:14,700 --> 00:22:17,462
have you been watching this whole time?

185
00:22:17,870 --> 00:22:20,715
No, I was doing some work in the storehouse

186
00:22:20,773 --> 00:22:21,229
No!

187
00:22:23,208 --> 00:22:26,994
You were secretly watching and other people didn't know about?

188
00:22:27,898 --> 00:22:28,358
But what?

189
00:22:30,013 --> 00:22:33,708
I'm asking if you just watched without telling me!

190
00:22:36,320 --> 00:22:37,334
I'm sorry...

191
00:22:37,447 --> 00:22:38,172
Idiot!

192
00:22:40,014 --> 00:22:40,681
Idiot!

193
00:22:41,676 --> 00:22:42,369
Koi-san

194
00:22:45,306 --> 00:22:46,306
I'm so sorry

195
00:22:47,564 --> 00:22:49,732
Please forgive me....

196
00:22:53,035 --> 00:22:53,682
Koi-san.

197
00:22:55,991 --> 00:22:57,380
Hold on

198
00:22:58,138 --> 00:22:58,992
Don't touch me!

199
00:22:59,302 --> 00:23:00,779
Leave me alone.

200
00:23:00,811 --> 00:23:02,797
Koi-san,I'm so sorry

201
00:23:03,039 --> 00:23:05,579
Please forgive me....

202
00:23:06,013 --> 00:23:08,073
Please forgive me....Koi-san

203
00:23:08,979 --> 00:23:09,823
Koi-san.

204
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:13,767
Koi-san.

205
00:23:24,120 --> 00:23:25,481
Oh, it's cold!

206
00:23:29,365 --> 00:23:31,117
It's going to snow quite a bit, isn't it?

207
00:23:34,110 --> 00:23:35,512
What happened to your hand?

208
00:23:37,956 --> 00:23:38,973
Hmm? No, nothing.

209
00:23:39,397 --> 00:23:39,917
I see

210
00:23:50,590 --> 00:23:51,915
Listen, Koi-san

211
00:23:52,973 --> 00:23:55,050
Master says the same thing

212
00:23:55,761 --> 00:23:56,334
What?

213
00:23:57,145 --> 00:23:58,800
about your marriage arrangements

214
00:24:00,802 --> 00:24:04,248
I talked it over with him a lot.

215
00:24:19,314 --> 00:24:22,702
How about getting married with Sasuke?

216
00:24:27,186 --> 00:24:29,600
Sasuke knows about you well

217
00:24:30,652 --> 00:24:32,000
For Koi-san

218
00:24:32,170 --> 00:24:32,790
Mom

219
00:24:34,454 --> 00:24:35,194
Mom

220
00:24:36,789 --> 00:24:38,982
Sasuke is our servant, he belongs to our master, right?

221
00:24:41,020 --> 00:24:42,965
No matter how I am blind

222
00:24:44,051 --> 00:24:46,378
I have no intention of marrying him.

223
00:24:47,289 --> 00:24:48,676
But Koi-san

224
00:24:49,633 --> 00:24:54,084
besides Sasuke, who else will take care of you for the rest of your life?

225
00:24:54,810 --> 00:24:58,725
Sasuke will take care of me for the rest of my life just like this?

226
00:24:59,840 --> 00:25:01,239
I know how you feel...

227
00:25:03,360 --> 00:25:05,439
but no matter how disabled or wealthy I am

228
00:25:06,050 --> 00:25:09,493
I don't want you guys to make fun of me.

229
00:25:09,950 --> 00:25:12,950
I will never, ever make fun of Koi-san in my life

230
00:25:13,191 --> 00:25:16,644
I have no intention of undergoing training anymore.

231
00:25:18,019 --> 00:25:19,183
I do not take lessons from the master.

232
00:25:19,980 --> 00:25:20,738
Koi-san.

233
00:25:22,136 --> 00:25:24,831
My master are Koto and shamisen.

234
00:25:31,386 --> 00:25:35,214
I will continue making music for the rest of my life.

235
00:27:20,339 --> 00:27:21,855
Thank you for the meal.

236
00:27:24,261 --> 00:27:25,105
I want a refill.

237
00:27:26,667 --> 00:27:27,706
Hold on.

238
00:27:34,402 --> 00:27:35,511
Bring this

239
00:27:55,042 --> 00:27:56,066
Katsudon?

240
00:27:56,481 --> 00:27:58,550
Well, what's going on?
That's strange

241
00:28:01,738 --> 00:28:03,730
I wonder if a ghost has attached itself to you.

242
00:28:46,050 --> 00:28:46,730
Madam?

243
00:29:13,030 --> 00:29:14,909
You don't need to laugh.

244
00:29:45,049 --> 00:29:45,643
Koi-san?

245
00:29:46,980 --> 00:29:48,136
He is in the drying area.

246
00:30:35,592 --> 00:30:37,682
Isn't that Sasuke Sasuke?

247
00:30:38,550 --> 00:30:39,331
Dad?

248
00:30:41,222 --> 00:30:43,308
What do you do in the middle of the night?

249
00:30:45,049 --> 00:30:46,690
Is that your shamisen?

250
00:30:47,831 --> 00:30:48,433
Yes.

251
00:30:49,380 --> 00:30:52,667
I've been saving up my wages and tips

252
00:30:56,800 --> 00:30:59,284
It's too cold to talk here.

253
00:31:12,668 --> 00:31:14,893
What exactly are you here?

254
00:31:17,503 --> 00:31:18,503
You came here for training.

255
00:31:20,479 --> 00:31:22,503
Aren't you a servant here for generations?

256
00:31:23,444 --> 00:31:28,400
You didn't come here to study musicians.

257
00:31:29,683 --> 00:31:30,558
Have you ever thought about that?

258
00:31:30,931 --> 00:31:32,151
Sorry, sorry

259
00:31:34,090 --> 00:31:43,190
No matter how many shamisens you buy, I will break them just like this.

260
00:31:46,425 --> 00:31:48,839
You get it?

261
00:31:57,058 --> 00:31:57,464
So?

262
00:31:58,397 --> 00:32:07,682
It’s inconvenient that Sasuke is giving shamisen lessons.

263
00:32:08,316 --> 00:32:13,152
I told him to practice in the warehouse.

264
00:32:14,613 --> 00:32:18,565
He said People who are blind are always in complete darkness like this

265
00:32:19,517 --> 00:32:23,627
So he imagine Koi-san is also playing in the dark

266
00:32:23,985 --> 00:32:28,619
He's so happy to know that he's also part of the same dark world

267
00:32:29,050 --> 00:32:30,597
He said that it was fun.

268
00:32:31,508 --> 00:32:37,042
He is trying hard to get into Koi-san's good graces.

269
00:32:41,761 --> 00:32:42,503
